    {
      "id": 490312,
      "username": "elizaso1991",
      "name": "Elizaso1991",
      "created_at": "2026-01-06T07:30:05.216Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thank you for such a detailed and practical answer!</p>\n<p>Your explanation clarifies the fundamental design decisions behind ERPNext BOM naming. I completely agree that introducing custom fields and generating a human-readable identifier via a server script is the most robust and upgrade-safe solution. It’s very helpful to hear how this approach works in real-world pharmaceutical implementations.</p>\n<p>Thanks again for sharing your expertise and the experience from Sigzen Technologies. It’s reassuring to see this best-practice model in active industry use.</p>\n<p>Much appreciated!</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/elizaso1991/{size}/92893_2.png",
      "trust_level": 1,
      "post_number": 5,
